-- INSTRUMENT: Broadcasting (Exemption) Order 2022 (S 211/2022), made under s 60 of the Act.
-- Deposit: ../../../broadcasting-exemption-order-2022/registers/source-bundle/BA1994-S211-2022.txt (lawplain's rendering, line-broken by hand).

§ `Paragraph 2: Exemption`

-- src:5 | Exemption
-- src:6 | 2. The Minister exempts the following broadcasting holding companies from section 33 of the Act:
-- src:7 | ( a ) SPH Media Holdings Pte. Ltd.;
-- src:8 | ( b ) SPH Media Trust.
@ref para 2(a) and (b) (src:5-8)
GIVEN d IS A DATE
      name IS A STRING
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`S 211/2022 para 2 the company is exempt from section 33 of the Act, on` MEANS
    IF `the Exemption Order 2022 as deposited is the text in force on` d
    THEN JUST (name EQUALS "SPH Media Holdings Pte. Ltd." OR name EQUALS "SPH Media Trust")
    ELSE NOTHING
